---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Bill tracker"
seoTitle: "Ohio Family Court Bill Tracker: Custody & Support Bills"
summary: "Ohio bills affecting family courts: status, our position, and the rubric reasoning behind it."
type: page
schema: bills
permalink: /reform/bill-tracker/
---
{% from "partials/bill.njk" import bill with context %}
<div class="wrap">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/reform/">Reform</a></li><li aria-current="page">Bill tracker</li></ol></nav>
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Bill tracker</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ summary }}</p>
    <p class="meta-line">Status is entered manually from <a href="https://www.legislature.ohio.gov/" rel="noreferrer">legislature.ohio.gov</a>. Always check the official record for the latest action.</p>
  </header>

  <p class="legend">
    Positions:
    <span class="pill pill--position pill--support">Support</span>
    <span class="pill pill--position pill--oppose">Oppose</span>
    <span class="pill pill--position pill--amend">Amend</span>
    <span class="pill pill--position pill--watching">Watching</span>
  </p>

  <div class="bill-list">
    {% for b in bills %}
      {{ bill(b) }}
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty">No bills tracked yet.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>